#|comment, then asks for the new one.
#|
#|- Type your new comment (several lines are fine), then press Enter on an
#|  empty line to finish.
#|- If you press Enter right away without typing anything, the existing
#|  comment is kept untouched.
#|- It always ends with a liquid-glass HTML report (liquid_set_zip_comment.html)
#|  and opens it - even if nothing was changed.  Add --no-open to only save
#|  it, or --no-report to skip it.
