#|#    CYAN     = THIS script's colour (headings / totals / labels, bars)   BLUE   checking / verifying
#|#    MAGENTA  OLD / existing value         PINK     NEW / changed value
#|#    WHITE    file names / key values      GREY     dividers / small labels
#|#    TOOL     same colour in Termux, in the saved HTML and in liquid_Commands.html (PALETTE tool/tool2)
